# Context of apps/web/Dockerfile (the repository root). An allowlist: everything is out unless named, so the
# backend, the mobile app, docs, tests, .git and any .env never reach the daemon or an image layer.
*

!apps/web/
!packages/api-contract/

# Inside the allowed trees: host-installed and host-built output, local env files, generated types.
apps/web/node_modules/
apps/web/dist/
apps/web/.env*
apps/web/src/shared/api/schema.gen.ts
**/.DS_Store
